{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42955","headline":"婕妤怨 · 郑鏦","name":"婕妤怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南国承欢日，东方候晓时。\n那能妒褒姒，祗爱笑唐儿。\n宝叶随云髻，珠丝锻履綦。\n不知飞燕意，何事苦相疑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑鏦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42955.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42955","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}